:''Not to be confused with [[Li'l Shirou (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Shirou the Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a [[Daily Bonus]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]].  He was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 457
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Shirou the Cat
|name2 = Novice Mage Shirou Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Novice Mage Shirou Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Unfortunately, Shirou barely functions as an anti-Dark outside of the early game. He may have decent DPS against Dark enemies, but he has nothing else going for him. His single target attacks can do nothing against the aggressive spam that many Black stages are known for. His abysmal HP and range mean that he would not survive long enough to actually use his DPS even against a single enemy. His cost and cooldown don't do him any favors, either. Even without the existence of any decent anti-Dark, Shirou is unfortunately doomed to the designation of 'UR/Labyrinth fodder' that haunts many collaboration units.

